<title>BELGIUM: Belgian PS party admit &quot;legal&quot; gift from Dassault.</title>
<headline>Belgian PS party admit &quot;legal&quot; gift from Dassault.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian francophone socialist party (PS), at the heart of a controversy over party funding, said on Friday it received a &quot;legal&quot; gift from French defence firm Dassault in 1987.</p>
<p>&quot;I have just found out, following the raids that took place yesterday, that we received a legal gift from Dassault of 1.2 million (Belgian) francs...which was entered into our books and declared to the finance ministry in 1987,&quot; PS Chairman Philippe Busquin told a news conference.</p>
</text>
